    "text": "<p>Match List<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>&nbsp;with List<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>II</mi></math></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>&nbsp;(process)</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>II</mi></math> (catalyst)</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(a)</td>\t\t\t<td>Deacon&#39;s&nbsp;process</td>\t\t\t<td>(i)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ZSM</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(b)</td>\t\t\t<td>Contact process</td>\t\t\t<td>(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CuCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(c)</td>\t\t\t<td>Cracking of hydrocarbons</td>\t\t\t<td>(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ni</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(d)</td>\t\t\t<td>Hydrogenation of vegetable oils</td>\t\t\t<td>(iv)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below-</p>",
