    "text": "In manufacture of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> (contact process), <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math> is used as a catalyst. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ni</mi></math> catalysts enables the hydrogenation of fats. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CuCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is used as catalyst in Deacon&#39;s process. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ZSM</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math> used as catalyst in cracking of hydrocarbons.",
